The probe campaign is finished. All 66 cells are used, every arm is decided or closed, and nothing is queued.

**What the last two cells showed (slot pruning on document questions).** Slot pruning means keeping only the compressed slots the decoder attends to most once it has seen the question. Each cell was compared with the same model's plain cell on the same 1,500 questions. Judge accuracy is the share of answers the Qwen3-8B judge accepts.

| cell | seed | slots kept per question (of 431) | judge accuracy ↑ | plain ↑ | difference (95% CI) | McNemar p |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| keep an eighth | 43 | 52 (.121×) | .605 | .615 | −.010 [−.025, +.005] | .21 |
| keep a sixteenth | 42 | 25 (.059×) | .596 | .610 | −.014 [−.030, +.002] | .115 |

- **Keeping an eighth is now settled at both seeds.** With the earlier seed-42 cell (+.003), both seeds stay within the .02 noise band. Given the question, about seven eighths of the slots go unused.
- **Keeping a sixteenth is provisional (one seed only).** It also stays inside the band, and no cell is left to repeat it at seed 43.
- **Each halving below a quarter costs a little more.** Eighth vs quarter at seed 43 is −.015 (p=.03); sixteenth vs eighth at seed 42 is −.017 (p=.03). Both steps are under the band, so neither counts as a result. No level tested loses .05 or more, so the share where pruning really starts to hurt is still unknown.
- **Both cells are healthy.** Each ran once with no preemption, has 0 unparseable judge answers and 1,500 rows, and ran on the same node image as its baseline.

**What I updated.** I recorded the results, metrics and verdicts in expmon and wrote the decision into the campaign law (arm E is now closed). I also updated the deliverable `docs/probe_campaign_2026-11.md` and rewrote `campaign_probes/STATE.md`. `expmon display` still shows 0 table rows, a known expmon defect. I filed one complaint: expmon has no step for paired comparisons, so I copy the numbers by hand. NEXT is `done`.

**Your decision (optional):** to find where pruning starts to hurt, raise the cell cap by 2 for two more cells: a sixteenth at seed 43, and a thirty-second (about 13 slots per question) at seed 42. Otherwise, nothing needed from you. The closing report and retrospective come after the window ends on 2027-02-09.
